# Quarto's freeze (in _freeze/) stores an MD5 hash of each source file, and
# GitHub Actions checks files out with LF line endings. Keep the book sources
# LF on every machine, so a local render's hashes match the CI checkout and
# CI never tries to rerun R.
*.qmd text eol=lf
*.R   text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.bib text eol=lf
*.scss text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
